                                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-3" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="Director&#39;sMessage"  ><p align="justify">The Student Evaluation Division (SED) of IGNOU is entrusted with the responsibility of conducting the examinations and evaluation for two sessions of examinations in a year both in offline and online modes. With the support of Regional Evaluation Centres, Regional Centres and Schools of Studies, SED has been smoothly conducting the examination work ever since the establishment of the University. Maintaining strict confidentiality in examination matters has been the hallmark of SED. Most of the activities of SED such as filling of examination form, re-evaluation, obtaining scanned copy of answer sheets, award of degree, diploma, and certificate through Digilocker, etc. are available on a click of a button. SED is striving to make full use of information technology for providing student support services for examination related matters.<br/>
<p align="right">
Registrar, SED <br>
(Prof. Jaideep Sharma)
</p>
</div>
